@startuml
actor "会员" as Member
participant "API 网关" as Gateway
participant "会员服务" as MemberSvc
participant "推荐服务" as RecSvc
participant "预约服务" as ReservationSvc
participant "猫咪档案服务" as CatSvc
participant "通知服务" as Notify
Member -> Gateway: 提交桌位预约
Gateway -> MemberSvc: 校验登录与偏好授权
MemberSvc --> Gateway: 会员画像摘要
Gateway -> CatSvc: 查询猫咪可互动状态
CatSvc --> Gateway: 可互动猫咪列表
Gateway -> RecSvc: 请求桌位/猫咪推荐
RecSvc --> Gateway: 推荐方案与理由
Gateway -> ReservationSvc: 创建预约
ReservationSvc --> Gateway: 预约号与状态
Gateway -> Notify: 发送确认通知
Gateway --> Member: 返回预约成功
@enduml
